      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Search finds the path s \u2192 d \u2192 c \u2192 e \u2192 t in Gf.   Room on each edge: s\u2192d = 4, d\u2192c = 4, c\u2192e = 2, e\u2192t = 1\nBottleneck = min(4, 4, 2, 1) = 1   \u2192   push 1 unit along the whole path\nFlow network: f(s,d) 8 \u2192 9, f(d,c) 0 \u2192 1, f(c,e) 0 \u2192 1, f(e,t) 8 \u2192 9 FULL\nResidual graph: every path edge loses 1 of room; backward edges d\u2192s, c\u2192d, e\u2192c, t\u2192e gain 1.  Full now, so it leaves Gf: e\u2192t\nFlow value |f| = 21 + 1 = 22",
      "originalText": "Search finds the path s \u2192 d \u2192 c \u2192 e \u2192 t in Gf.   Room on each edge: s\u2192d = 4, d\u2192c = 4, c\u2192e = 2, e\u2192t = 1\nBottleneck = min(4, 4, 2, 1) = 1   \u2192   push 1 unit along the whole path\nFlow network: f(s,d) 8 \u2192 9, f(d,c) 0 \u2192 1, f(c,e) 0 \u2192 1, f(e,t) 8 \u2192 9 FULL\nResidual graph: every path edge loses 1 of room; backward edges d\u2192s, c\u2192d, e\u2192c, t\u2192e gain 1.  Full now, so it leaves Gf: e\u2192t\nFlow value |f| = 21 + 1 = 22",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "ch12-12-ff-step-5-n14",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 15
    }
